1
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,820
(Sheldon:)Are you sure you have
enough comics?

2
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:09,480
(Sheldon:)You're going to be monitoring
the telescope for 12 hours,

3
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,380
(Sheldon:)and by my estimate,
you've only selected

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,520
(Sheldon:)seven hours of reading material.

5
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,190
(Sheldon:)That's even factoring in

6
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:17,820
(Sheldon:)your difficulty in parsing
American comic book idioms

7
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:20,290
like "Bamf!" and "Snikt!"

8
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:22,160
(Raj:)Is that racist?

9
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,790
(Raj:)It feels racist.

10
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,160
(Howard:)Don't be oversensitive.

11
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:29,170
He's calling you illiterate,
not your race.

12
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:32,100
(Raj:)Oh, okay. Good.

13
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,470
(Raj:)I don't need
more comics.

14
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:35,440
(Raj:)Howard's gonna stop by,
we're gonna play

15
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:38,310
(Raj:)Intergalactic Battleship
and Indian Monopoly.

16
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:41,080
(Sheldon:)I don't care for
novelty editions of Monopoly.

17
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:44,550
I prefer the classics:
regular and Klingon.

18
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,020
(Howard:)Actually, Indian Monopoly's

19
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,250
(Howard:)just like regular,
except the money's in rupees,

20
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:52,490
(Howard:)instead of hotels
you build call centers,

21
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:56,190
(Howard:)and when you pick a Chance card,
you might die of dysentery.

22
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,650
(Howard:)Just FYI,

23
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:01,020
(Howard:)that was racist.

